<p id="elk-2c620b17-ac16-4c21-b981-b89e44a54b7a"><em>Welcome to </em><a data-analytics-id="inline-link" href="https://www.whowhatwear.com/reviews" target="_blank" data-url="https://www.whowhatwear.com/reviews" data-hl-processed="none" data-article-category="beauty" data-mrf-recirculation="inline-link" data-before-rewrite-localise="https://www.whowhatwear.com/reviews"><u><em>Deep Reviews</em></u></a><em>&mdash;your one-stop destination to discover the absolute best products and brands the beauty industry has to offer. The Who What Wear staffers you already know and trust will research, test, and review the market's most sought-after and buzzed-about products to see which formulas (of the hundreds up for consideration) are worth your hard-earned money and attention. You can expect honest, uncensored feedback and no-BS recommendations our hard-to-please testers endorse without reservations.</em></p><div id="ad-unit-1" class="ad-unit"></div><p>The majority of our <a data-analytics-id="inline-link" href="https://www.whowhatwear.com/reviews" target="_blank" data-url="https://www.whowhatwear.com/reviews" data-hl-processed="none" data-article-category="beauty" data-mrf-recirculation="inline-link" data-before-rewrite-localise="https://www.whowhatwear.com/reviews"><u>Deep Reviews</u></a> will feature our editors' honest, ultra-hot takes on entire product categories or multiple products from a particular beauty brand, but every so often, we'll sprinkle in a special single-product format called <a data-analytics-id="inline-link" href="https://www.whowhatwear.com/tag/honestly-i-love-it" target="_blank" data-url="https://www.whowhatwear.com/tag/honestly-i-love-it" data-hl-processed="none" data-article-category="beauty" data-mrf-recirculation="inline-link" data-before-rewrite-localise="https://www.whowhatwear.com/tag/honestly-i-love-it"><u>Honestly, I Love It</u></a>. As the name suggests, these reviews will hone in on one standout beauty formula our editors can't shut up about. This time around, I'm highlighting <a data-analytics-id="inline-link" href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=kXQk6%2AivFEQ&amp;mid=43176&amp;u1=whowhatwear-us-1328751467629330022&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.urbanoutfitters.com%2Fshop%2Fexperiment-super-saturated-barrier-support-serum%2F" target="_blank" data-url="https://www.urbanoutfitters.com/shop/experiment-super-saturated-barrier-support-serum/" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" rel="sponsored noopener" data-hl-processed="hawklinks" data-article-category="beauty" data-google-interstitial="false" data-placeholder-url="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=kXQk6%2AivFEQ&amp;mid=43176&amp;u1=hawk-custom-tracking&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.urbanoutfitters.com%2Fshop%2Fexperiment-super-saturated-barrier-support-serum%2F" data-merchant-name="Urban Outfitters (US)" data-merchant-id="204344" data-merchant-network="LSfutureusLlc" data-merchant-url="urbanoutfitters.com" data-mrf-recirculation="inline-link">Experiment Skincare's Super Saturated</a> ($28).</p><figure class="van-image-figure inline-layout " data-bordeaux-image-check id="elk-625880f6-389f-42ca-bc23-5be103e15093"><div class="image-full-width-wrapper"><div class="image-widthsetter" style="max-width:1200px;"><p class="vanilla-image-block" style="padding-top:120.83%;"> <picture data-new-v2-image="true">
<source type="image/webp" srcset="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-1200-80.jpg.webp 1920w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-1200-80.jpg.webp 1600w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-1200-80.jpg.webp 1280w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-1024-80.jpg.webp 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-768-80.jpg.webp 768w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-415-80.jpg.webp 415w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-360-80.jpg.webp 360w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-320-80.jpg.webp 320w" sizes="(min-width: 710px) 670px, calc(100vw - 30px)" />
<img src="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP.jpg" alt="Reviewed By a Beauty Editor: Experiment Super Saturated" srcset="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-1200-80.jpg 1920w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-1200-80.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-1200-80.jpg 1280w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-1024-80.jpg 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-768-80.jpg 768w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-415-80.jpg 415w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-360-80.jpg 360w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP-320-80.jpg 320w" sizes="(min-width: 710px) 670px, calc(100vw - 30px)" loading="lazy" data-new-v2-image="true" data-original-mos="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP.jpg" data-pin-media="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/aGfCPZuxU9MABAy3jvn2AP.jpg" class="rounded-[var(--image--border-radius,0)]">
</picture></p></div></div><div class="credit">(Image credit: @shawnasimonee)</div></figure><p id="elk-e68e6f79-3b3c-42c0-959b-e399504e4128">If you've dealt with extensive <a data-analytics-id="inline-link" href="https://www.whowhatwear.com/beauty/skin/skincare-products-for-a-damaged-skin-barrier" target="_blank" data-url="https://www.whowhatwear.com/beauty/skin/skincare-products-for-a-damaged-skin-barrier" data-hl-processed="none" data-article-category="beauty" data-mrf-recirculation="inline-link" data-before-rewrite-localise="https://www.whowhatwear.com/beauty/skin/skincare-products-for-a-damaged-skin-barrier">skin barrier damage</a> like I have, then you know how frustrating it can be trying to find the right products to hydrate your skin. If your skin barrier isn't in great shape, it has a hard time holding on to moisture, no matter how much you apply. I've tried countless products that claim to repair the skin barrier with no luck, but I recently found a different kind of support formula that achieved the impossible for me.</p><div class="my-6 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] lg:my-8" data-component-name="JwPlayer:Carousel" data-jwp-carousel data-jwp-carousel-payload='{"ids":{"playerID":"sVvk4TT6","searchPlaylistID":"h9V3nfer","divID":"botr_h9V3nfer_sVvk4TT6_div","fallbackPlaylistID":"h9V3nfer","fallbackDivID":"botr_h9V3nfer_sVvk4TT6_div","key":"CPFHrGphJ\/3ueXEE8N4db8vv2KbCyAtjIXYlaXvYqxqJP6x2","tintLogo":true,"useSearchPlaylist":false,"enabled":true},"signPostingEnabled":true,"signPostingLinkEnabled":false,"waitForAdLoad":false,"hidePlayerOnDesktop":true,"hidePlayerOnMobile":false,"hidePlayerOnTablet":false}'><div class="flex flex-nowrap items-center justify-between gap-3 bg-zinc-900 px-[14px] py-3" data-jwp-carousel-header><div class="flex min-w-0 shrink items-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-article-heading capitalize leading-5 text-white whitespace-nowrap"><span class="jwp-carousel-title-mobile"></span><span class="jwp-carousel-title-desktop">Latest Videos From</span><span class="jwp-carousel-brand">Who What Wear</span></span></div></div><div class="aspect-video w-full min-h-[200px] lg:min-h-[330px] relative overflow-hidden bg-black" data-jwp-carousel-container><div class="absolute inset-0 size-full" data-jwp-carousel-player-host></div><div class="absolute inset-0 size-full items-center justify-center bg-white" data-jwp-carousel-fallback></div></div><div class="min-h-[44px] bg-zinc-900 px-[14px] py-3" data-jwp-carousel-signposting><span class="invisible block truncate text-sm font-bold leading-5 text-white" data-jwp-carousel-signposting-title></span></div></div><a id="elk-seasonal"></a><aside data-article-category="beauty" data-block-type="embed" data-only-fallback-offers="true" data-render-type="fte" data-show-price-rounded="yes" data-skip="dealsy" data-widget-type="seasonal" class="ecom-root"></aside><p id="elk-e68e6f79-3b3c-42c0-959b-e399504e4128-1">To give you a bit more backstory on my skin, I've been dealing with severe dehydration and barrier damage. This happened after I used tretinoin for years without getting enough hydration. Back then, I fully believed the way to clear up my <a data-analytics-id="inline-link" href="https://www.whowhatwear.com/tag/acne" data-auto-tag-linker="true" data-url="https://www.whowhatwear.com/tag/acne" data-hl-processed="none" data-article-category="beauty" data-mrf-recirculation="inline-link" data-before-rewrite-localise="https://www.whowhatwear.com/tag/acne">acne</a> was by drying my skin out. I now know how seriously wrong that was thanks to a little education from dermatologists and aestheticians, but unfortunately, by the time I did learn, the damage had been done. I don't use tretinoin anymore and am a huge advocate for more gentle retinoids, but my barrier was left stripped, dry, sensitive, and reactive after that. I'm now (slowly, but surely) healing it by keeping things gentle and hydrating my skin at every turn.</p><div id="ad-unit-2" class="ad-unit"></div><p>As I mentioned above, though, it's tough for your skin to hold on to moisture when your barrier is so damaged&mdash;it takes a high concentration of hydrating actives to trigger those repair mechanisms. Luckily, TikTok-famous brand Experiment offers a $28 formula that does the trick. I began using it with low expectations since I'd used a lot of barrier repair formulas previously that didn't do much, but this serum is the real deal.</p><aside data-component-name="Recirculation:ArticleRiver" data-recirculation-type="inline" data-mrf-recirculation="Trending Bar" data-nosnippet class="clear-both pt-2 pb-0 mb-4">
