<img src="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/B3NbHPp3LQJfmJMC4aWwSL.jpg" alt="Before and After photos using Experiment Super Saturated" srcset="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/B3NbHPp3LQJfmJMC4aWwSL-1200-80.jpg 1920w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/B3NbHPp3LQJfmJMC4aWwSL-1200-80.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/B3NbHPp3LQJfmJMC4aWwSL-1200-80.jpg 1280w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/B3NbHPp3LQJfmJMC4aWwSL-1024-80.jpg 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/B3NbHPp3LQJfmJMC4aWwSL-768-80.jpg 768w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/B3NbHPp3LQJfmJMC4aWwSL-415-80.jpg 415w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/B3NbHPp3LQJfmJMC4aWwSL-360-80.jpg 360w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/B3NbHPp3LQJfmJMC4aWwSL-320-80.jpg 320w" sizes="(min-width: 710px) 670px, calc(100vw - 30px)" loading="lazy" data-new-v2-image="true" data-original-mos="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/B3NbHPp3LQJfmJMC4aWwSL.jpg" data-pin-media="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/B3NbHPp3LQJfmJMC4aWwSL.jpg" class="rounded-[var(--image--border-radius,0)]">
</picture></p></div></div><div class="credit">(Image credit: @shawnasimonee)</div></figure><p id="elk-f99640b1-3460-4ca8-8e5e-62e3309daaf6">I'm really into Experiment and its approach because the brand doesn't do the obvious when it comes to formulation. Rather than putting out a hydrating serum that's like everything else on the market, one of the brand's co-founders Lisa Guerrera told me that they wanted to create a super hydrator that <em>doesn't</em> feature typical ingredients like hyaluronic acid. Instead, they decided to use a 30 percent concentration of glycerin, a well-tolerated and loved hydrating ingredient that when used in higher concentrations can repair the skin barrier.</p><p>As you can see in the "Before" photo above, my skin was pretty dull and dehydrated&mdash;it also felt a bit like sandpaper on the surface. After using Super Saturated for just three weeks, I started to notice a huge difference in my skin. It felt less tight and dry for starters, and even after just a few days of use, it gave me a serious dewy glow.</p><div id="slice-container-newsletterForm-articleInbodyContent-y3yjPiWGeQmGeY6PEDYnkm" class="slice-container newsletter-inbodyContent-slice newsletterForm-articleInbodyContent newsletterForm-articleInbodyContent-y3yjPiWGeQmGeY6PEDYnkm slice-container-newsletterForm" data-newsletter-form-root="" data-observe-viewable="true" data-component-name="Newsletter:NewsletterForm" style="--newsletter-form-primary-color: #1B1B1B; --newsletter-form-secondary-color: #1B1B1B; --newsletter-form-background-color: #f6f6f6; --newsletter-form-text-color: #000; --newsletter-form-wrapper-padding: 40px; --newsletter-form-justify-content: center; --newsletter-form-strapline-margin: 0 0 20px; --newsletter-form-header-font-size: 2em; --newsletter-form-header-line-height: normal; --newsletter-form-header-margin-bottom: 10px; --newsletter-form-alignment: center; --newsletter-form-container-max-width: none;">
