    </aside><figure class="van-image-figure inline-layout " data-bordeaux-image-check id="elk-59a78544-2524-4821-8695-072e9725d6c3"><div class="image-full-width-wrapper"><div class="image-widthsetter" style="max-width:1200px;"><p class="vanilla-image-block" style="padding-top:142.58%;"> <picture data-new-v2-image="true">
<source type="image/webp" srcset="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-1200-80.jpg.webp 1920w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-1200-80.jpg.webp 1600w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-1200-80.jpg.webp 1280w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-1024-80.jpg.webp 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-768-80.jpg.webp 768w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-415-80.jpg.webp 415w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-360-80.jpg.webp 360w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-320-80.jpg.webp 320w" sizes="(min-width: 710px) 670px, calc(100vw - 30px)" />
<img src="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa.jpg" alt="Experiment Super Saturated" srcset="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-1200-80.jpg 1920w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-1200-80.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-1200-80.jpg 1280w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-1024-80.jpg 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-768-80.jpg 768w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-415-80.jpg 415w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-360-80.jpg 360w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa-320-80.jpg 320w" sizes="(min-width: 710px) 670px, calc(100vw - 30px)" loading="lazy" data-new-v2-image="true" data-original-mos="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa.jpg" data-pin-media="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ZKFhL4YEsHLMWiKQKnLPRa.jpg" class="rounded-[var(--image--border-radius,0)]">
</picture></p></div></div><div class="credit">(Image credit: @shawnasimonee)</div></figure><p id="elk-5432f8c7-3f6c-4560-b28f-9556dd7e9156">Like I mentioned above, this formula features a whopping 30 percent concentration of glycerin. This is a lot higher than most other serums on the market that feature glycerin as an ingredient. In concentrations of 25% or above, glycerin immediately increases water content in the skin, enhances its ability to retain moisture, and even repairs the skin barrier. In addition, high molecular weight polyglutamic acid hydrates the skin's surface, giving it a plump, dewy appearance.</p><p>It also does a great job of soothing redness and irritation with ingredients like bisabolol (an active ingredient in chamomile) and prickly pear extract which binds moisture into the skin while protecting against irritation from stronger actives (like retinoids). Allantoin acts as another soothing ingredient that helps speed the recovery of stressed-out skin. It's also one of my all-time favorite ingredients since it works so well for my sensitive, acne-prone skin. Lastly, niacinamide rounds out the formula which does <em>so </em>many great things including controlling excess oil, improving barrier function, and lightening dark spots.</p><figure class="van-image-figure inline-layout " data-bordeaux-image-check id="elk-7d923a49-0db1-4349-8464-40aa5fcc4578"><div class="image-full-width-wrapper"><div class="image-widthsetter" style="max-width:1200px;"><p class="vanilla-image-block" style="padding-top:112.25%;"> <picture data-new-v2-image="true">
<source type="image/webp" srcset="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-1200-80.jpg.webp 1920w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-1200-80.jpg.webp 1600w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-1200-80.jpg.webp 1280w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-1024-80.jpg.webp 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-768-80.jpg.webp 768w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-415-80.jpg.webp 415w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-360-80.jpg.webp 360w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-320-80.jpg.webp 320w" sizes="(min-width: 710px) 670px, calc(100vw - 30px)" />
<img src="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma.jpg" alt="Experiment Co-Founder Lisa Guerrera" srcset="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-1200-80.jpg 1920w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-1200-80.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-1200-80.jpg 1280w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-1024-80.jpg 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-768-80.jpg 768w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-415-80.jpg 415w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-360-80.jpg 360w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma-320-80.jpg 320w" sizes="(min-width: 710px) 670px, calc(100vw - 30px)" loading="lazy" data-new-v2-image="true" data-original-mos="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma.jpg" data-pin-media="https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/stpvBe2kcmwizkmSBRyNma.jpg" class="rounded-[var(--image--border-radius,0)]">
</picture></p></div></div><div class="credit">(Image credit: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/lisagrrera/" target="_blank" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/lisagrrera/" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" data-hl-processed="none" data-article-category="beauty">@lisagrrera</a>)</div></figure><p id="elk-455b0287-4eb0-43a9-b8fe-98ff18de18a4">Guerrera shared a bit more about Experiment and specifically why Super Saturated is such a starring formula. Being two chemists, Guerrera and her co-founder Emmy Ketcham want to carve out a new space in the beauty industry that's rooted in education <em>and </em>fun, experimental skincare. "Our main mission with Experiment is to reimagine what 'science' looks like in beauty and ultimately change how consumers relate and interact with science in their everyday lives," she explains. 'Science' in beauty has looked one way for so long: black and white, lab coats, dropper bottles, and sterile. While it builds trust with consumers, it doesn&rsquo;t present science as something relatable, cool, [and] fun! That&rsquo;s why Experiment focuses on really unique, fun, and deeply efficacious products to show science can be colorful, culturally cool, and kinda weird!"</p><p>Super Saturated is the perfect formula to showcase this. "Hydrating serums is such a crowded, undifferentiated category filled with serums that by and large feature hyaluronic acid as the primary hydrating ingredient and the star of the product formula&mdash;and their textures tend to be very similar across the board," she says. "What makes Super Saturated so unique is the high, 30 percent glycerin concentration in a water-based serum format with a stringy, gloopy texture that our community of self-proclaimed 'Lab Rats' love! Glycerin is a very common ingredient, but it's usually in smaller concentrations (less than five percent) in most of your skincare. [This is] because high amounts of glycerin can get sticky and tricky to formulate with&hellip; so Super Saturated was very hard to pull off formulation-wise. But it was worth it because, at concentrations above 25%, glycerin gains these really amazing irritation-protection and barrier-repairing properties. The texture isn&rsquo;t sticky per se, but it's definitely a 'heavy-weight.'</p><p>While it wasn't easy to formulate, Guerrera and Ketcham knew they had something special on their hands. "I&rsquo;m blessed to have an amazing co-founder, Emmy, who is the chemist and formulator behind all our skincare. We have an in-house lab that allows us to really experiment (pun intended) and find the best formulas. Our primary goal was to create the most effective hydrating serum that was essential in your routine and was truly bringing something new to the market. With Super Saturated, we wanted glycerin to be the star ingredient even though most beauty marketers ignore it as a 'boring' ingredient. We knew, as chemist founders, that glycerin is really one of the best hydrators we have and has so many other cool properties beyond hydration. I remember when Emmy came to me with the first formulation of Super Saturated, she [said], 'I was messing around in the lab and I made this 30% glycerin concentrate thing&mdash;not sure if it's a good idea, though,' and the second she said that I knew we had something our community would <em>love</em>. It took a lot of tweaking to get the texture just right, so we did over 40 iterations on the product."</p><p>Guerrera even shared a few ways she likes to use this one in her routine. "When my skin needs heavy-duty hydration and soothing I like to 'marinate' (that's what I call it) in Super Saturated. I do about four to five pumps of [it] and layer my Avant Guard reusable sheet mask on top and hang out for 30 minutes or more. Because of the ear loops on Avant Guard, I can do some cleaning around my apartment or do work without the mask slipping. The mask really force feeds your skin the serum and your skin is so plump and calm after. It can really heal any irritation quickly and it&rsquo;s great for makeup prep too!"</p><a id="elk-3a16cf05-306d-4691-a582-549df84444d5"></a><h2 id="more-experiment-products-i-love-3">More Experiment Products I Love</h2><a id="elk-collectionwidget-d85cf9010744623ef9b48373f52d5a87"></a><div class="product-container standard-product-container product-block-no-wrap"><div class="product-block-row"><div class="featured_product_block featured_block_standard" data-id="2fd96eb1-bc74-4e1e-8edc-d1986a630990" id="elk-2fd96eb1-bc74-4e1e-8edc-d1986a630990">
